# Instruction pairs that share a resource of the processor: `X | Y | cycles:RESOURCE ...`,
# Y not to be issued that many cycles after X (0: not in one bundle); read by
# src/shave/conflicts.rs. Resources: `irf.rN` / `irf.wN` read / write port N of the
# integer register file, `vrf.rN` / `vrf.wN` of the vector register file, `shared.N`
# another shared datapath. Functional facts of the processor (see NPU.md "Provenance").
